  194 2AFB ~            ; bit either way. Both significands have their lowest eleven bits zero (fifty-three bits at the
  195 2AFB ~            ; top of sixty-four): the multiplier's lowest byte would only shift a zero qr, so the loop starts
  196 2AFB ~            ; at its second, and the multiplicand's lowest byte adds nothing, so the addition starts at its
