 2151 2AFB ~            ; DE:HL = a / b. Restoring division of the significands, a bit at a time: with a's at least b's
 2152 2AFB ~            ; -- doubled, and the exponent one less, if not -- the quotient is in [1, 2), its leading one at
 2153 2AFB ~            ; bit 31 of the thirty-two bits rpack takes. The remainder is in E H L with its twenty-fifth bit,
 2154 2AFB ~            ; after the shift, in the carry; the divisor's top byte in D and its low word negated in BC, so
 2155 2AFB ~            ; that taking it off is ADD HL,BC and SBC A,D on the carry turned round. A low word of zero would
 2156 2AFB ~            ; leave no carry, so then D is one less and the low word taken as 65536. The top bytes alike, the
 2157 2AFB ~            ; same ADD on a copy of HL tells the rest. The quotient's bits go in at the bottom of fpx,
 2158 2AFB ~            ; inverted, behind a 1 that comes out at the top when there are eight; each full byte is pushed.
 2159 2AFB ~            ; Three bytes, the twenty-four bits of the result; then the round bit, bit 7, and below it only
 2160 2AFB ~            ; whether anything remains, at bit 0 -- the seven bits between were computed for nothing.
 2161 2AFB ~            ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
