    1 2FF5              ; runtime32.asm -- empty. The thirty-two-bit routines are in runtime.asm, with the sixteen-bit
    2 2FF5              ; ones they call, so that the assembler can leave out whatever a program does not use; see the
    3 2FF5              ; comment at the top of that file. Kept so that command lines naming it still work.
    4 2FF5
